  "id": "oxford_teslatronpt",
  "manufacturer": "Oxford Instruments NanoScience (Oxford NanoScience Ltd, trading as Quantum Design Oxford)",
  "model": "TeslatronPT",
  "family": "cryogen-free (Cryofree) superconducting magnet system with variable temperature insert",
  "description": "Integrated cryogen-free superconducting magnet system with a 50 mm static-exchange-gas variable temperature insert (1.5-300 K). Standard solenoid magnets of 8 T, 12 T or 14 T, or a 6/1/1 T vector-rotation magnet. Optional HelioxVT (He-3, <300 mK) and KelvinoxJT (dilution, <25 mK) inserts. All nanoscience.oxinst.com URLs now redirect to qd-oxford.com; specifications are taken from the qd-oxford.com product page and the 2026 brochures.",
